5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know how this affects our daily flow! I'll look into the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the arrival times in the badge records.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll check the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'll look into the drawn plan against the staff survey and what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll take the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'll check out the two project strands within earshot last spring and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Does anyone else think we should check the sound levels? @Shion is doing it, but I wonder if it's a big deal for everyone.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"It is a valid point, but since Shion is already handling the readings, we should trust his findings to avoid duplicating effort.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Toshio. We have a wide range of data points covered, so let's focus on our assigned tasks for now.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I'll be sure to share the exact numbers once I have them. I'm curious if the noise is actually the main issue or just a distraction.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm just excited to see if sitting closer actually helps us talk more! I'll let you know what I find about those project strands.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I wonder if the badge records will show we all arrive at the same time, or if some of us are way earlier than others!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"That would be a useful detail to know, as it might influence how we decide to allocate the available space.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"It will also help us determine if a first-come, first-served system would be fair or if it would simply favor the early birds.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Exactly. Fairness is often a matter of timing, and the data will tell us if that's a risk we're willing to take.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I hope it's not too unfair! I just want us all to feel happy and connected, no matter when we walk through the door.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm all set with my choices! I'll stick with the morning routine and badge records. I can't wait to see what the data says!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I am also satisfied with my selections. I will proceed with the billing basis and the facilities quote.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'll stick with the staff survey and the joiners' reports. I think these will give us a good sense of the human element.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,I'm settled as well. Sound readings and the physio's notes it is. Let's see if the physical reality of the room matches our assumptions.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Yumi,,Me too! I'm sticking with the project strands and the unplanned shuffles. Let's get to it!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
